// ODIN scenario templates — a read-through cache of a partner system's
// exercise template catalog.
//
// An OdinTemplate is never authored here: it is ingested from ODIN and only
// ever read by this service. `id` is ODIN's own identifier, not a cache
// surrogate key. List and Get are the only RPCs defined by this file: List
// backs the template picker, Get backs the preview drawer opened from a
// picker card (#1723) and serves exclusively from the local cache — it never
// makes an upstream ODIN call.

