/**
 * OdinInfoboxProperty is one raw row of a cached ODIN infobox, passed
 * through verbatim. `value` (singular) and `values` (repeated) are used
 * instead of a `oneof` deliberately: under
 * `always_print_fields_with_no_presence`, a singular string always renders
 * as `""` and a repeated field always renders as `[]`, so either shape is
 * always representable in a Pact contract — whereas a `oneof` reintroduces
